      "id": "claim_e67e4767cdf041ea8dba4d8644f1c199",
      "statement": "zstd_pool provides a thread-local pool of Zstd compressors (one per compression level) and a single decompressor, with contexts returned to a global pool (max 32 per level for compressors, 32 total for decompressors) on thread exit, eliminating per-call CCtx/DCtx allocation overhead on hot paths.",
