    {
      "id": "claim_7aa3f73f0d60450d80bcca8e2a77e9a4",
      "statement": "A persistent scoped worker pool (par_for_index) spawns num_cpus-1 threads (clamped 1..15) named oifs-chunk-w{N} at first use; workers park on a Condvar, each dispatch increments a generation counter to avoid pthread_create churn, and the calling thread participates via dynamic work-stealing with fallback to sequential execution when total<=1 or pool lock is contended.",
