      "id": "claim_8cd2e5d6a5c941aaa94a6e6953591d95",
      "statement": "ChunkReadCache (src/disk/caches.rs) is an 8-slot LRU cache for individual 64KB chunk decompressions of seekable files; keyed by (inode_id, chunk_idx, raw_entry, valid_len); copy_slice_if_hit serves sub-chunk reads directly under shared read lock; sequential access detection triggers parallel prefetch of up to 4 subsequent chunks via par_for_index.",
